&lt;li>Group visits welcome&lt;/li>
&lt;/ul></description></item><item><title>Volunteer</title><link>http://localhost:1313/support/volunteer/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>http://localhost:1313/support/volunteer/</guid><description>&lt;p>Volunteers play a key role in museum operations, visitor services, and event support. Learn about opportunities to contribute your time and skills to our exhibitions and programs.&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>Bibliography</title><link>http://localhost:1313/support/bibliography/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>http://localhost:1313/support/bibliography/</guid><description>&lt;p>The bibliography page lists primary and secondary sources used in our exhibitions and research. It is a resource for students, historians, and anyone interested in local heritage.&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>Calendar</title><link>http://localhost:1313/calendar/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>http://localhost:1313/calendar/</guid><description>&lt;p>Our calendar highlights exhibition openings, special programs, and public events. Check back often for new updates and seasonal activities.&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>On the Lawn</title><link>http://localhost:1313/exhibitions/on-the-lawn/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>http://localhost:1313/exhibitions/on-the-lawn/</guid><description>&lt;p>The lawn area hosts outdoor exhibitions, community programs, and seasonal events. This outdoor space allows visitors to engage with the museum across landscaped grounds and public displays.&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>Sponsor</title><link>http://localhost:1313/support/sponsor/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>http://localhost:1313/support/sponsor/</guid><description>&lt;p>Sponsorship helps fund exhibits, education programs, and community initiatives. Discover how your organization can support the museum and amplify its impact.&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>Children's Gallery</title><link>http://localhost:1313/exhibitions/childrens-gallery/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>http://localhost:1313/exhibitions/childrens-gallery/</guid><description>&lt;p>The Children&amp;rsquo;s Gallery offers family-friendly exhibits, interactive displays, and programs designed to engage young visitors with history and the arts.&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>Donate</title><link>http://localhost:1313/support/donate/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>http://localhost:1313/support/donate/</guid><description>&lt;p>Donations help maintain exhibitions, educational programs, and historic preservation efforts. Learn how your contribution supports the Blacksburg Museum and Cultural Foundation.&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>Featured Artist</title><link>http://localhost:1313/featured-artist/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>http://localhost:1313/featured-artist/</guid><description>&lt;p>The featured artist section celebrates local and regional creators whose work is on view in our gallery spaces. Discover their stories, creative process, and exhibition themes.&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>Visit</title><link>http://localhost:1313/visit/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>http://localhost:1313/visit/</guid><description>&lt;p>Plan your visit to the Blacksburg Museum and Cultural Foundation.&lt;/p>
